.DS_Store
# Per-machine, never committed: miserc.local.toml (machine class), config.local.toml ([vars]).
*.local.toml
!*.local.toml.example
__pycache__/
# mise (>= 2026.10.20) writes lock sidecars to .mise/locks/; those are
# committed, the rest of .mise/ is not. Older sidecars still live in locks/.
.mise/*
!.mise/locks/
